{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SHRIMP GAME</strong> is an atmospheric third-person looter shooter RPG set in a decaying underwater world replete with horrific sea creatures and <strong>Lovecraftian Bosses</strong>.<br>Pilot your Submersible Hydrodynamic Research Integrated Marine Platform (SHRIMP), master the\u00a0<strong>six elemental classes</strong> with <strong>powerful fusion abilities</strong>, and unlock specialized <strong>SHRIMP Platforms </strong>each with their own unique strengths and personalities.  <br>Explore the sunken ruins solo or in <strong>6-player co-op,</strong> or <i><strong>KRILL</strong></i> your friends in <strong>chaotic PvP</strong> modes like Shrimp Royale, Shrimp Tag, and Capture the Turtle!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PREDATORS OF THE DEEP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824880/extras/193a9e06517e425df460fac099b47c31.poster.avif?t=1772900697\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824880/extras/193a9e06517e425df460fac099b47c31.webm?t=1772900697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824880/extras/193a9e06517e425df460fac099b47c31.mp4?t=1772900697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle massive bosses of the deep from volcano-bound hermit crabs to kaiju-sized electric eels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face swarms of aquatic fauna like murderous betta fish, dangerous dust crabs, and hostile sea sponges</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BAND TOGETHER (OR NOT) BENEATH THE WAVES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824880/extras/d2cfaab05ab51be7b88159df8d6196a7.poster.avif?t=1772900697\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824880/extras/d2cfaab05ab51be7b88159df8d6196a7.webm?t=1772900697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824880/extras/d2cfaab05ab51be7b88159df8d6196a7.mp4?t=1772900697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight and SHRIMP together across the entire campaign in multiplayer co-op up to 6 pilots </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Krill your friends in PVP with games such Royale, Tag, Boss Mode, and Capture The Turtles</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ARMAMENTS OF THE ABYSS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824880/extras/684ae03d13ca1f0f84bbdc641597d1db.poster.avif?t=1772900697\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824880/extras/684ae03d13ca1f0f84bbdc641597d1db.webm?t=1772900697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824880/extras/684ae03d13ca1f0f84bbdc641597d1db.mp4?t=1772900697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 6 base elemental powers with the potential to create 2 dozen different element fusions like Magma, Smog, Moon, Demon, and Bone to complement your build</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from 11 different Submersible Hydrodynamic Research Integrated Marine Platforms (SHRIMP) each with their own different strengths and play styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your build with over 2 dozen weapons from heavy cannon shots, shotgun blasts, or machine-gun projectiles with added stat upgrades and rarities</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SECRETS OF THE SUNKEN WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824880/extras/bd3380420e6ec4de4909049005024ee5.poster.avif?t=1772900697\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824880/extras/bd3380420e6ec4de4909049005024ee5.webm?t=1772900697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824880/extras/bd3380420e6ec4de4909049005024ee5.mp4?t=1772900697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and perhaps restore an underwater realm on the brink of destruction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover ancient ruins, complete puzzles hiding treasures, and traverse cryptic domains\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet and help a variety of eccentric and interesting characters each with their own motivations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel the depths with a watery Drum N' Bass inspired soundtrack with over a dozen songs</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2824880?t=1772900697","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2824880?t=1772900697","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824880/60505b7dbfc7c3ab2eaeb03a91ebe95b79ff4440/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772900697","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824880/60505b7dbfc7c3ab2eaeb03a91ebe95b79ff4440/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772900697","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":